Q: $match not matches all the fields inputed A: <p>I have addressed the question, and here's my solution: I have implemented an expression within the pipeline to match the fields. I used the `$expr` and `$and` operators for this purpose.</p>
<pre><code>
    if (Object.keys(filter).length &gt; 0) {
      pipeline.push({ $match: { $expr: { $and: filter } } });
    }
</code></pre>
